# Handover Index — MDS Work / 2026

**What this file is.** One place to see every handover document in this folder, newest first,
so you can tell *which* doc to open without reading all of them. Each entry records the date,
what the session actually changed, which code files it touched, the traps it found, and what it
left unfinished.

**Keeping it current.** Whenever a new handover document is written into `_handover_docs/`,
add an entry here in the same session — newest at the top of both the table and the detail
list — and move anything it resolved out of *Open items across all sessions* at the bottom.
The handover doc holds the detail; this file holds the trail.

